			},
			"date": "2025-03-06T18:26:01.292Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@AmeliaBR\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>AmeliaBR</span></a></span> I think you’re right! It’s hard (for me) to get on board with the feature for only those reasons though</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "114117076327088943",
			"parentId": "114116890544958378",
			"url": "https://masto.ai/@litherum/114117076282167718",
			"author": {
				"name": "Litherum",
