			},
			"date": "2025-03-06T19:25:22.200Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://masto.ai/@litherum\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>litherum</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@AmeliaBR\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>AmeliaBR</span></a></span> for the record you can delete the default types or rename them to something else so in that regard I might classify both systems as more custom than standard?</p><p>two of the three default types are also represented as default labels for new repos too 🤷‍♂️</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
