			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> My understanding is that they are defined at the organisation level while labels aren’t. So I’m remembering them as “organisation labels” and think that they are only useful for organisation managers.</p>",
